cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "liveplotter: non-blocking live plotting of experimental data"
abstract: >-
  A Python package for real-time visualisation of experimental data. User
  functions returning NumPy arrays are polled in background threads and
  plotted with pyqtgraph in a separate process, so acquisition code, consoles
  and IDEs are never blocked by the GUI.
authors:
